  <data name="ResetButton.[using:Windows.UI.Xaml.Controls]ToolTipService.ToolTip" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Default Function: Resets tuning options back to their default values.&#x0a;&#x0a;FOR ADVANCED USERS: Hold shift while pressing to perform a hard reset that wipes all of app's data everywhere, making it as if it was freshly installed. Might also prompt you for reverting back to Default RTX/Default LUT files if needed, so your defaults aren't lost the next time you use the app.</value>
