  <data name="LaunchLUTManagerButton.[using:Windows.UI.Xaml.Controls]ToolTipService.ToolTip" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Provides simpler, more reliable alternative to BetterRTX that works across all game versions by modifying RTX's default color look up tables.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="LaunchAlchitexButton.[using:Windows.UI.Xaml.Controls]ToolTipService.ToolTip" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>RTX Reactor can generate RTX support for any regular Minecraft Bedrock Edition texture pack.
&#x0a;It does so by generating PBR texture sets for each texture, adding RTX-specific configurations, and making adjustments to textures where needed for ray tracing.
&#x0a;&#x0a;Ideally, packs tagged as RTX Reactor Candidates are most likely to benefit from this feature.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="LaunchBetterRTXManagerButtonText.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>BetterRTX manager</value>
  </data>
  <data name="LaunchBetterRTXManagerButton.[using:Windows.UI.Xaml.Controls]ToolTipService.ToolTip" xml:space="preserve">
